---
// AI Courses Detail Section
---

<section id="ai-courses" class="section-padding bg-surface-50">
  <div class="container-narrow">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-start">
      <!-- Left: Info -->
      <div class="reveal">
        <span class="section-label">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
            <path d="M10.394 2.08a1 1 0 00-.788 0l-7 3a1 1 0 000 1.84L5.25 8.051a.999.999 0 01.356-.257l4-1.714a1 1 0 11.788 1.838L7.667 9.088l1.94.831a1 1 0 00.787 0l7-3a1 1 0 000-1.838l-7-3zM3.31 9.397L5 10.12v4.102a8.969 8.969 0 00-1.05-.174 1 1 0 01-.89-.89 11.115 11.115 0 01.25-3.762zM9.3 16.573A9.026 9.026 0 007 14.935v-2.957l2.3.986a3 3 0 002.4 0l2.3-.986v2.957a9.026 9.026 0 00-2.3 1.638 1 1 0 01-1.4 0z" />
          </svg>
          AI Education
        </span>
        <h2 class="section-title mb-6">
          AI curriculum built for the
          <span class="gradient-text">UAE classroom</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle mb-8">
          Our prepackaged AI courses are designed from the ground up to align with the UAE Ministry of Education AI Framework. Each course is ready to deploy — complete with lesson plans, hands-on exercises, assessments, and teacher guides.
        </p>

        <div class="space-y-5 mb-10">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-accent-100 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent-700" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-1">MOE Certified Alignment</h4>
              <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">Every course maps directly to the national AI framework competencies and learning outcomes.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-accent-100 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent-700" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 11H5m14 0a2 2 0 012 2v6a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-6a2 2 0 012-2m14 0V9a2 2 0 00-2-2M5 11V9a2 2 0 012-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h6a2 2 0 012 2v2M7 7h10" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-1">Ready to Deploy</h4>
              <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">Complete packages with lesson plans, exercises, assessments, and teacher training materials.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-accent-100 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent-700" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM7 10a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-1">Schools & Students</h4>
              <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">Institutional licensing for schools and self-paced access for individual students.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <a href="#contact" class="btn-accent">
          Request Course Catalog
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3" />
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: Course Cards -->
      <div class="space-y-5">
        <!-- Course 1 -->
        <div class="card p-6 reveal reveal-delay-1">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-accent-400 to-accent-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 text-white font-bold text-lg shadow-lg shadow-accent-500/20">
              01
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1">
                <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900">AI Foundations</h4>
                <span class="text-xs font-medium px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-accent-100 text-accent-700">Grades 1–4</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">Introduction to AI concepts through interactive activities. Students explore how AI recognizes patterns, makes decisions, and is used in everyday life.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Course 2 -->
        <div class="card p-6 reveal reveal-delay-2">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-400 to-brand-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 text-white font-bold text-lg shadow-lg shadow-brand-500/20">
              02
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1">
                <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900">Data & Machine Learning</h4>
                <span class="text-xs font-medium px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-brand-100 text-brand-700">Grades 5–8</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">Hands-on experience with data collection, visualization, and training simple ML models. Students learn how AI systems learn from data.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Course 3 -->
        <div class="card p-6 reveal reveal-delay-3">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-400 to-purple-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 text-white font-bold text-lg shadow-lg shadow-purple-500/20">
              03
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1">
                <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900">AI Applications & Ethics</h4>
                <span class="text-xs font-medium px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-purple-100 text-purple-700">Grades 9–12</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">Advanced topics including neural networks, natural language processing, computer vision, and the ethical responsibilities of AI development.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Course 4 -->
        <div class="card p-6 reveal reveal-delay-4">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-400 to-orange-500 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 text-white font-bold text-lg shadow-lg shadow-amber-500/20">
              04
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1">
                <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900">AI for Educators</h4>
                <span class="text-xs font-medium px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-amber-100 text-amber-700">Professional Development</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">Teacher training programme covering AI pedagogy, classroom integration strategies, assessment methods, and how to guide student AI projects.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
